OL,3,GNEWSAFamily of Jagtar Singh Johal say
OL,4,Adetained Scot has been granted bail
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a Scottish Sikh activist
OL,7,Fwho has been locked up in India for
OL,8,Falmost nine years without conviction
OL,9,Fhave said he has been granted bail.
OL,11,FJagtar Singh Johal, from Dumbarton, was
OL,12,Farrested in 2017 in connection with
OL,13,Falleged terror offences.
OL,15,FHe was arrested for his alleged role in
OL,16,Fa series of targeted killings of
OL,17,Freligious and political figures.
OL,19,FHis family said they were still waiting
OL,20,Ffor the details of what will happen
OL,21,Fnext but are "relieved" by the Indian
OL,22,Fcourt's decision.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
